                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> 32-bit Windows Vista<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Core i3 / AMD A6 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 2 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> 512MB VRAM NVIDIA GeForce 8xxx series / ATI Radeon HD 3xxx series. OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 650 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Integrated Intel graphics are not supported. Intel HD 4000-series or better should work, but may have issues. The game may run on Windows XP, but we have not been able to test it.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Sistema Operativo *:</strong> 64-bit Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Core i5 / AMD FX 2.4Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 4 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> 1024MB VRAM NVIDIA GeForce GTX 4xx series / ATI Radeon HD 5xxx series. OpenGL 3.3 support<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 650 MB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> Integrated Intel graphics are not supported. Intel HD 4000-series or better should work, but may have issues. The game may run on Windows XP, but we have not been able to test it.</li></ul>"
